{"a":[249,249],"h":"<p>249.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"226\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 226.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 24.0 32.3 32.3 39.0 39.0 51.8 51.8 59.3 66.0 66.0 81.8 81.8 98.3 106.6 106.6 114.0 120.8 140.3 150.8 165.0 180.8 187.6 187.6 196.6 203.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"120.8 140.3 150.8 165.0 187.6 196.6 203.3 210.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> vaktaki bunlar temam olub Talut askerleriyle hareket etti<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 56.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 33.7 40.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> askerine hıtaben şöyle dedi: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"189\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 188.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 24.0 32.3 39.0 39.0 54.7 54.7 63.7 63.7 75.7 82.6 82.6 89.3 96.0 96.0 102.7 102.7 118.6 125.3 125.3 125.3 132.0 139.6 155.3 155.3 165.7 165.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"24.0 32.3 89.3 118.6 155.3 172.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah sizi behemehal bir ırmakla imtihan edecektir <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 132.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 45.7 62.3 62.3 69.7 90.0 90.0 100.6 109.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.7 69.7 100.6 109.6 116.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> binaenaleyh ondan her kim içerse<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"104\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 104.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.7 27.7 27.7 34.4 34.4 67.4 67.4 74.2 81.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"50.2 50.2 74.2 81.0 87.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> benden değil, <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 132.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 32.3 39.0 39.0 49.4 65.3 65.3 74.3 90.7 90.7 101.3 108.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.3 49.4 74.3 101.3 108.0 116.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve her kim ona ağzını sürmezse<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"94\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 93.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.7 27.7 27.7 34.6 34.6 50.3 50.3 57.0 57.0 63.7 63.7 70.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"57.0 70.6 77.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o şüphesiz bendendir, benim askerimden veya beni sevenlerdendir <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"212\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 212.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 39.0 39.0 54.7 54.7 61.4 68.2 68.2 75.7 75.7 93.7 111.7 119.2 126.0 126.0 135.0 150.7 150.7 161.2 177.0 181.4 189.0 189.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.2 61.4 93.7 111.7 119.2 161.2 181.4 195.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ancak eliyle bir avuc alan içlerinden müstesna, bu kadarına ruhsat var. Doğruda doğru ağızla sümürmiye müsaade yok, Talut bir emîr sıfatiyle bu emri, bu talimatı vermişken<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"219\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 33.7 33.7 40.4 40.4 56.2 61.4 68.2 75.0 75.0 81.7 97.4 102.0 109.4 109.4 125.2 125.2 132.0 132.0 138.7 138.7 154.4 161.2 169.4 169.4 176.2 176.2 183.7 195.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"81.7 102.0 183.7 195.7 202.4\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ırmağa gelince askerin birazından ma'adası hep ondan içtiler, emri dinlemediler.- </p>"}